.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Abena&nbsp;is highly motivated, dependable, and eager to embrace new challenges as she will be working with the communications team, to further develop her skill set and contribute meaningfully.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Abena&nbsp;Nhyira Boafo is a graduate from the University of Ghana, where she earned a Bachelor&#8217;s degree in French. Over the past year, she honed her organizational and communication skills while gaining hands-on experience as an Administrative Assistant within the French Department&nbsp;of the university.&nbsp; Her proficiency in French documentation and translation, combined with strong communication abilities,<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":10,"featured_media":13130,"parent":0,"template":"","meta":{"advgb_blocks_editor_width":"","advgb_blocks_columns_visual_guide":"","profile-name":"Abena Nhyira Boafo","profile-position":"Communications Assistant - French","profile-tagline":""},"tags":[],"people_types":[12],"acf":[],"featured_img":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2024\/11\/IMG_8034-Edit-1.jpg","coauthors":[],"author_meta":{"author_link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/author\/charlene\/","display_name":"charlene"},"relative_dates":{"created":"Posted 12 months ago","modified":"Updated 5 days ago"},"absolute_dates":{"created":"Posted on November 27, 2024","modified":"Updated on November 17, 2025"},"absolute_dates_time":{"created":"Posted on November 27, 2024 9:50 pm","modified":"Updated on November 17, 2025 1:09 pm"},"featured_img_caption":"","tax_additional":{"post_tag":{"linked":[],"unlinked":[],"slug":"post_tag","name":"Tags"},"people_types":{"linked":["<a href=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/person_type\/management\/\" class=\"advgb-post-tax-term\">Management<\/a>"],"unlinked":["<span class=\"advgb-post-tax-term\">Management<\/span>"],"slug":"people_types","name":"Person Type"}},"series_order":"","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\